  "_source": "contracts/Erc20Htlc.sol (git blob 0650f1400ce654a22c929cf81675002427323533), modified since it was copied from MudwoodLabs/pyrxd-eth-htlc@7b7d005e9148a8ffd88b1a2e36b0e36450e0e40a:contracts/src/Erc20Htlc.sol (git blob a0c9010f0125e5ba9baba4970108a6b20b8405e9); changed: refund() reverts NothingToRefund, without settling, when the balance is zero; pragma pinned to 0.8.24 (was ^0.8.20); comments on the claim-error order and the sweep guard; a deployer immutable (msg.sender of the constructor), and refund() reverts NotRefunder unless called by the refundee or the deployer",
